# Task 12 — Successful registration

The request used a unique, temporary email and a generated test-only password. The password value is intentionally not stored.

Actual cURL request:

```sh
curl -fsS -X POST "$BASE_URL/api/secondchance/auth/register" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d "$(jq -nc --arg name 'Coursera Test User' --arg email "$TEST_EMAIL" --arg password "$TEST_PASSWORD" '{name:$name,email:$email,password:$password}')"
```

